==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suf|en|grift|er|id2=agent noun}}; or an alteration of {{m|en|grafter|t=a corrupt person, one who accepts bribes}}, which is essentially a {{doublet|en|nocap=1}} of the same word.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɡɹɪftɚ/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɡɹɪftə/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|informal|North America}} A [[con artist]]; someone who pulls [[confidence game]]s.
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:confidence trickster}}
